WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
JULIE: We started Leo's evaluation today, but we did not complete it.
I am already due in my next visit.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
MAYA: I know we need to come back, but I am not sure what today means
or what I should do before then.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
NARRATOR: CareScribe organizes four plain-language anchors:
Today. Next. Who. When.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
JULIE: The second visit continues the evaluation.
We are not naming a diagnosis.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
MAYA: I will notice how Leo asks for help, more, or stop
with words, gestures, or actions.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
NARRATOR: A shared, clinician-reviewed plan preserves evidence,
uncertainty, responsibilities, and timing.
